<title>BRAZIL: Brazil posts $5.539 bln 1996 trade deficit.</title>
<headline>Brazil posts $5.539 bln 1996 trade deficit.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil posted a $5.539 billion trade deficit in 1996, with exports totalling $47.747 billion and imports of $53.286 billion, the Ministry of Industry and Commerce said in a statement.</p>
</text>
